    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Kim Policarpio",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111804244850514230802/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWFPH4KiG1nH0zZFfEVd-jokZahEsrTm_roDWboxJt62geWKNA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "My daughter and I have been clients of Memories Nails and Spa for a few years now.  We are always happy with the quality of work and service we get from the staff there. Lee is a very attentive owner who cares about ensuring that her customers are satisfied. I have had my nails done by Rose and Ryan who are friendly and meticulous with their work. My daughter has had her acrylics done by Sapphire who also does the most beautiful nail art and has done whatever my daughter has shown her through pictures. But this place doesn’t just do the nails. I have also had waxing and facials done there and Kerstin does the BEST facials I have ever experienced. She takes the time to explain all the steps involved and ensures that you are relaxed and comfortable during the entire experience. Finally, the salon is always clean. I highly recommend Memories Nails and Spa for your esthetics needs.",
        "time": 1753718673,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Katherine Fortier",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116828333604876011854/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJj_va43OwymOv5u7kyblS2p6iBXWdlLnTnxxeAfLza0X2P9nW=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Firstly, the salon is extremely clean and well-kept! Love the decor. Secondly, I’m always greeted upon entering the salon. The staff is very kind and courteous. When it comes to the nails, I get gel refill sets and I always leave absolutely obsessed with my nails!",
        "time": 1763298208,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sana El Hachaichi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117750540266750296776/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXqqKjf_M80ZIA1N045nqKjCh9T4WDRIcxc-7BQ8IW4n0puOqdLIQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I really needed this massage, and I’m so glad I came. From the start, I felt comfortable, listened to, and completely at ease. The massage was exactly what my body needed, not rushed, very intuitive, and deeply relaxing. You can truly feel the care, skill, and attention in every movement. I left feeling lighter, calmer, and so much better both physically and mentally. I wouldn’t hesitate to come back and highly recommend Rose. Thank you for such a wonderful experience",
        "time": 1767886695,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Emma Holder",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101593319378520943332/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
